NAME
     top - what is running, again and again

SYNOPSIS
     top [-b] [-n N] [-d SEC] [-u USER]

DESCRIPTION
     top prints a summary -- load, processes, memory -- and the busiest
     processes, and does it again every few seconds. q leaves.

OPTIONS
     -b        batch: print once and do not use the terminal's cursor
     -n N      stop after N updates
     -d SEC    seconds between updates
     -u USER   only that user's processes

SEE ALSO
     ps(1), vmstat(1), uptime(1)
